      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A May morning",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Everyone",
            "accent": "is coming along."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "We met very early in Praiano on 23 May. The family were staying closer to the main road and had a bit of a climb to reach our meeting point. By the time they arrived, golden hour was almost over, but everyone was in a wonderful mood.",
            "I especially remember the children. They were curious, cheerful, and completely unfazed by the early start or the idea of walking around town with a photographer. That made our morning together a pleasure."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / Around the village",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "Praiano",
        "accent": "in bloom."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr1305",
        "cnr1420",
        "cnr1501",
        "cnr1642",
        "cnr1750",
        "cnr1896",
        "cnr1965",
        "cnr1980"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Around the village",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Praiano",
            "accent": "in bloom."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "We walked from the main street and its open views towards the church, then into the little lanes. Praiano was full of flowers, and there was something lovely to photograph at every turn.",
            "Nick and his family were happy to join in, and the pictures came easily. I enjoy the little moments between the group photographs just as much: a look, a laugh, the children finding something interesting."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dissolve",
      "eyebrow": "03 / After the session",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "I kept",
        "accent": "the camera out."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr1996",
        "cnr2126",
        "cnr2127",
        "cnr2144",
        "cnr2270",
        "cnr2333",
        "cnr2452"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "After the session",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "I kept",
            "accent": "the camera out."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "The best part happened after the photoshoot had officially finished. We carried on walking and stopped at a fruit shop for a little rest. The children had ice cream and some fruit, which went down very well.",
            "A little farther on, we found a beautiful view towards Positano. Of course, I took a few more photographs. It was a lovely way to finish a morning that none of us seemed in a hurry to end."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
